      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ buton þara oðer hæbbe, nele him mon nænne team geþafian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And unless he has some cognisance of one or other of these, he shall not be permitted to vouch for warranty.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et nisi alterutrum habeat, nolumus ei permittere ccnningam aliquam.</ab>
